From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BerryMC <148406068+BerryMC@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 11:33:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Skip event construction when no listeners are registered

Three event types are fired extremely often but are only consumed by
plugins that explicitly listen for them:

- BlockPhysicsEvent (CraftEventFactory.callBlockPhysicsEvent now
  returns null when there are no listeners, skipping the CraftBlock
  snapshot; BlockPlant/BlockTallPlant treat null as not-cancelled)
- PreCreatureSpawnEvent (natural spawning loop and mob spawners)
- VehicleEntityCollisionEvent (boat and minecart collide paths, six
  sites; the CraftEntity lookups are also skipped)

When no listener is registered the construction and dispatch are
skipped entirely, which is behavior-identical (an event nobody hears
cannot cancel anything) and saves allocation-heavy work on hot paths
such as redstone physics and entity collisions.

Based on Leaf's 'Skip BlockPhysicsEvent/PreCreatureSpawnEvent/
VehicleEntityCollisionEvent if no listeners' pattern.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/BlockPlant.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/BlockPlant.java
index 16c81562ff8e4d7a6e0af78b5baccc1b92ce7960..bbf063075cf7e6fc91eebc8042d49a483d100ae7 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/BlockPlant.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/BlockPlant.java
@@ -41,7 +41,10 @@ public class BlockPlant extends Block {
     protected void e(World world, BlockPosition blockposition, IBlockData iblockdata) {
         if (!this.f(world, blockposition, iblockdata)) {
             // CraftBukkit start
-            if (org.bukkit.craftbukkit.event.CraftEventFactory.callBlockPhysicsEvent(world, blockposition).isCancelled()) {
+            // Dionysus start - callBlockPhysicsEvent returns null when there are no listeners
+            org.bukkit.event.block.BlockPhysicsEvent blockPhysicsEvent = org.bukkit.craftbukkit.event.CraftEventFactory.callBlockPhysicsEvent(world, blockposition);
+            if (blockPhysicsEvent != null && blockPhysicsEvent.isCancelled()) {
+            // Dionysus end
                 return;
             }
             // CraftBukkit end
